        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-455c46cb-6441-4d6a-886a-94af32ef60a0" n="0354" facs="#m-23c400b7-764e-41df-a927-a42f1d71d130" /><div xml:id="m-f9161be7-3399-4497-86cc-c14370ae56f8">
            <lg xml:id="m-20b7465b-2ab6-45ea-af54-4f6c085669f9">
              <l xml:id="m-a810df89-f231-4784-a7b9-bbca0e65e072" facs="#m-51a1f375-efb7-4321-8fb4-c9eff717ce95" label="ambiguous">242</l><l xml:id="m-4b4cb534-a9a4-439e-bb72-59ed86e5d819" facs="#m-0278d0aa-e707-4f0b-a73e-f7f56cb5a55b" label="text-like">sunday at Sext.</l><l xml:id="m-136485f2-4db9-431d-bc77-512551de4178" facs="#m-478abeb6-01e6-4730-9f6b-cf9dba7d188c" label="lyrics-like">Anima méa in mánibus méis</l><l xml:id="m-c8bb53e7-3aa8-4a7a-b5ee-6dcdf620275d" facs="#m-d1f8bd55-e59e-44b1-a3b0-bd60b92d7bca" label="lyrics-like">In generatiónem et generatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-113837c5-6420-4177-82d2-f8333991e6e2" facs="#m-7c4dfbe6-0679-4c67-83c6-81d345e1d36f" label="lyrics-like">nem véritas túa:“fundásti tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-035695ca-1b84-4eb3-ad66-da84a94796c5" facs="#m-f5510ee4-8867-470c-acb9-793b7ee7fb03" label="lyrics-like">sémper :* et légem túam non súm</l><l xml:id="m-89c3e0c8-a3c8-4f03-a584-c7a869108306" facs="#m-e9e6bef1-d3d1-4bc5-a257-40a2af152819" label="ambiguous">oblitus.</l><l xml:id="m-c9a29fbd-b959-439c-b272-3fd86cd7a646" facs="#m-769f29e3-cc99-43ab-8f54-6f7adc4e53af" label="lyrics-like">ram, et pérmanet.</l><l xml:id="m-15378c94-adb5-49fc-87a9-3f7ff80bb14a" facs="#m-924fade0-a96f-4f36-8bc4-d9adc093339c" label="lyrics-like">Ordinatióne túa persevérat dies::</l><l xml:id="m-f4a126ef-8548-47a6-8d00-978aed3b444f" facs="#m-16b78607-6798-467c-8eba-b6c911036f60" label="lyrics-like">Posuérunt peccatóres láqueum</l><l xml:id="m-f44a0378-2e25-42ff-868c-338f1891c5cc" facs="#m-3a753f3d-ca31-42b3-baca-68abb47173be" label="lyrics-like">mihi:* et de mandátis tuis non</l><l xml:id="m-cc25326e-3651-4196-acfc-76c64aedfd7f" facs="#m-c7b766b1-ce61-47fe-95f1-cf6b2377901d" label="lyrics-like">quóniam ómnia sérviunt tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-1622d512-baa8-42f4-b591-0339d6df7ed2" facs="#m-e81ad2d5-19bc-4977-952c-623ea2373eb1" label="lyrics-like">errávi.</l><l xml:id="m-4b8fd5f1-0ed3-4284-bd61-3a767a132324" facs="#m-70102738-fd15-4dcc-aaf8-0acba0952a62" label="lyrics-like">Nisi quod lex túa meditátio méa</l><l xml:id="m-d6888c21-cdbc-4412-896a-b1b3851e1bb3" facs="#m-df8f46d2-0c9e-42e8-a594-bdba3a671233" label="lyrics-like">Haereditáte acquisivi testimónia</l><l xml:id="m-a1197743-71df-447a-a370-279ecbbd7fe8" facs="#m-6a69a427-f0d1-4d97-a7ea-f5012809e77a" label="ambiguous">est : * tunc forte periissem in hu¬</l><l xml:id="m-856b1ffe-e3ad-4bb0-88d1-8f2f7a8569b6" facs="#m-89a3dfe8-5d58-484e-97f6-ce62fa5db2cd" label="lyrics-like">militâte méa.</l><l xml:id="m-82a56435-4782-4f10-a445-1eb86b9995cb" facs="#m-211677f3-59d5-441d-969d-8221ad6da5c7" label="lyrics-like">túa in aetérnum :* quia exsultátio</l><l xml:id="m-6a913f14-c08a-4400-8280-c2a92d1bec0a" facs="#m-84317ad3-8dd6-4d42-83cc-d0e249f2964c" label="lyrics-like">In aetérnum non oblivíscar justi¬</l><l xml:id="m-fd32d371-78ba-4e25-853d-11f82abcd2ba" facs="#m-d86e85ac-6f4d-443a-a013-09b811613ba5" label="lyrics-like">córdis méi sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-09116f51-e8b8-4128-ad1a-c4f8d71036c3" facs="#m-9456b9c5-f1a2-4710-88a9-8ce371883bd9" label="lyrics-like">ficatiónes túas :* quia in ipsis vivi¬</l><l xml:id="m-56704e9d-7094-4c59-a261-b472de03f55a" facs="#m-2c0a254e-ee58-4a6c-9147-0e4c5807380d" label="lyrics-like">Inclinávi cor méum ad faciéndas</l><l xml:id="m-7f902556-de78-42f5-a051-3f17840ac12d" facs="#m-2d12bb76-7977-40d1-993f-ff7175741c88" label="lyrics-like">fieásti me.</l><l xml:id="m-074ed9bc-25d2-4fb4-bff7-cf047e106b1c" facs="#m-a7dd3150-a371-41f2-a80f-2584f972b300" label="lyrics-like">justificatiónes túas in aetérnum,</l><l xml:id="m-03280b1c-445e-47b7-8c1b-de0560141dd3" facs="#m-24f986a3-d420-4cd1-a00f-4cc6d7e6bfb5" label="lyrics-like">Túus sum égo, salvum mé fac:"</l><l xml:id="m-43cb3fad-ebd7-49af-bd61-bd87546acd3f" facs="#m-501eed07-ad05-49a6-bba6-0f47258613ac" label="lyrics-like">propter retributiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-4b7d015a-a4f1-4dba-a6a0-7c30f9644ffc" facs="#m-d969a509-7852-473a-9675-bcbefe1c4368" label="lyrics-like">quóniam justificatiónes túas exqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-07b0f10b-72b4-42f2-9888-50b143c9207a" facs="#m-c96fed13-2cd6-4db9-8041-b159c6b67c54" label="ambiguous">Psalm I18. VIII.</l><l xml:id="m-02db2db4-e7bb-4dca-a901-17f7ddb27bf0" facs="#m-cba00d8b-ac06-4d81-ac3c-17acaa4190eb" label="ambiguous">sivi.</l><l xml:id="m-1f70dff7-5ed8-4eb7-ba30-9b7d87d01f5a" facs="#m-6470276d-6ea6-407a-8f89-79b329432e6a" label="lyrics-like">Níquos ódio hábui: * et légem</l><l xml:id="m-54a56c44-f4da-4c5c-8591-78cacdd497b8" facs="#m-757dd595-c831-4538-afa7-8ab99fc7a9fb" label="lyrics-like">Me exspectavérunt peccatóres ut</l><l xml:id="m-dc3bde67-630e-4cea-a6de-cc5cd7052401" facs="#m-c6a94802-5d6c-493a-8e46-2326183dfa70" label="lyrics-like">I túam dilexi¬</l><l xml:id="m-781cf1bf-d6ad-4eaf-b61e-2545fcde2565" facs="#m-2c59ed98-175e-484c-9a34-26ddb04498d3" label="lyrics-like">pérderent me:*testimónia túa</l><l xml:id="m-3bb07002-3977-482b-9ec0-703f84e6aa80" facs="#m-6545ff45-3c14-44ce-a09a-7d8d6c88cc2e" label="lyrics-like">Adjútoretsuscéptor méus és tu:"</l><l xml:id="m-0db0e810-2558-4585-b19e-c29af2161efb" facs="#m-8fde6cc9-2fe7-4bea-b0d3-f260859722ac" label="lyrics-like">intelléxi.</l><l xml:id="m-ba9fd82d-b1be-401d-b60f-0c6e0b3a4f05" facs="#m-1237076d-2fca-4499-8e69-dfd2128416e2" label="lyrics-like">Omnis consummatiónis vidi fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-764d3c23-05f8-4de9-9bd1-d1a9d4de4fa0" facs="#m-ca0e199b-2e5e-4943-873e-c7a4e5aad4eb" label="lyrics-like">et in vérbum túum supersperávi.</l><l xml:id="m-0a72ebcb-f6d4-4222-a1c6-2a964a241a5f" facs="#m-b9cd07ad-d955-40ab-9c80-e1519db1dce9" label="lyrics-like">Declinâte a mé maligni: * et</l><l xml:id="m-77831c28-1a6a-437a-8474-9c3c4d426ff6" facs="#m-c0a05a27-2695-4123-945a-5ce519696191" label="lyrics-like">nem: *látum mandátum túum</l><l xml:id="m-4d5270dd-f96d-4ba7-a416-bb65ec1e9cde" facs="#m-0c39352a-b18b-4952-843d-7660260257b8" label="lyrics-like">scrutábor mandáta Déi méi.</l><l xml:id="m-cc05ed26-d595-4938-bbc7-076294eec84a" facs="#m-9711e789-3606-414f-933a-04925d11a4d1" label="ambiguous">nimis.</l><l xml:id="m-a0b82fbd-d7a2-4e17-a3fb-03f5a80c1a5c" facs="#m-c84883f1-b2a0-42e8-8d42-23b6065b1907" label="lyrics-like">Súscipe me secúndum elóquium</l><l xml:id="m-fa17de48-cc1e-4cd3-a6ec-c61086b0bd6d" facs="#m-f852afc5-913a-4518-aa3e-9b6f5a63d44d" label="ambiguous">Psalm I18. VII.</l><l xml:id="m-67b2afeb-05ff-4ed5-a2f8-2f6d43e65506" facs="#m-06c6eaa8-8e19-432f-9c98-d794724843f8" label="lyrics-like">túum, et vivam :* et non confundas</l><l xml:id="m-ff2121e2-32c4-4617-9316-dbaa93a9ec7e" facs="#m-b70c3cf8-8879-47d9-8daf-397dea98ef42" label="lyrics-like">Uómodo diléxi légem túam Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-99452753-9c5d-42af-8afa-47ebeb8b4a6e" facs="#m-fc3dec49-a30a-435c-a589-692d6603342d" label="lyrics-like">me ab expectatióne méa.</l><l xml:id="m-861169ed-ffec-4a8c-bdc3-87b2a6be5ba1" facs="#m-536d93c8-10cd-45fe-a769-1042c861e5d2" label="lyrics-like">U mine!* tóta die meditãtio méa</l><l xml:id="m-c35bd154-db83-4a22-b956-8198ea153857" facs="#m-147f0c56-6031-460f-9efb-41e1a1f98454" label="lyrics-like">Adjuva me, et sálvus éro:“et</l><l xml:id="m-3659329e-5efa-484d-8ed0-a68d80e89b03" facs="#m-47dc4c55-0f9f-4851-a03f-a8ea161dbbe0" label="lyrics-like">meditábor in justificatiónibus tuis</l><l xml:id="m-4ff5e354-f8bb-4ee4-b907-861a57650e08" facs="#m-8175a8bf-f139-465a-8b99-0e738de7b7b3" label="ambiguous">est.</l><l xml:id="m-661875df-e0b8-4086-be0f-911b6291d39c" facs="#m-0eb5e677-645f-4b91-8cae-ca32cfaa3765" label="lyrics-like">Super inimícos méos prudéntem</l><l xml:id="m-2722c9d0-3c4f-4fed-8edb-f82120eab707" facs="#m-d15acd2a-ebb3-4d05-b9de-8f24482b1a49" label="lyrics-like">sémper.</l><l xml:id="m-51ce54d1-03b3-41a7-8e70-3a1f28b886ba" facs="#m-dbcea971-0e1f-4b2b-89f4-dc9f1ad85e0c" label="lyrics-like">Sprevisti ómnes discedéntes a ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d27cffc-25e2-4ae1-8d5b-00253a0ec4bc" facs="#m-eedf59d6-1d3c-46bc-aec3-97c7af987fa4" label="lyrics-like">me fecísti mandáto túo:“ quia in</l><l xml:id="m-95229c8a-5627-4ea8-ba8f-14de914bb009" facs="#m-78eca7f6-443b-4a16-99b1-22331c7eee19" label="lyrics-like">aetérnum mihi est.</l><l xml:id="m-47e44b93-9b95-4857-9761-a4e939512cfd" facs="#m-f4edf3a6-7125-4861-ab7a-aede7eaae186" label="lyrics-like">diciis túis :* quia injústa cogitátio</l><l xml:id="m-53bfe127-7a92-4e99-8d86-f87b9c638a4e" facs="#m-cee3545a-5587-49cc-b29d-958ad96359d7" label="lyrics-like">Super ómnes docéntes me intel¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4857362-a828-4ec7-9448-1d171cdcc967" facs="#m-ec6fcf70-4f99-44c0-892f-002b4c11366e" label="lyrics-like">eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-f1f8d971-2a4a-4e41-84ba-2a6a2fa74d51" facs="#m-55e8637e-71ce-4b04-a074-8c4246d04a19" label="lyrics-like">lexi : * quia testimónia túa meditá¬</l><l xml:id="m-91906a31-bb74-467a-8add-a9bc15a91f26" facs="#m-7c6cce88-f530-4d35-9df1-69a3ae735f92" label="lyrics-like">Praevaricántes reputávi ómnes</l><l xml:id="m-8e6d6e82-9997-4358-8fcc-2654a75ca3d1" facs="#m-0c2241f1-c711-423d-aacf-6e162a75511b" label="lyrics-like">tio méa est.</l><l xml:id="m-d9719d29-efd9-45a5-ae6e-03bcc5fae518" facs="#m-96f48c40-c6ad-433a-84b8-224fd364032f" label="lyrics-like">peccatóres térrae :* ideo diléxi te¬</l><l xml:id="m-9714d64c-484b-4278-95da-0d672761d634" facs="#m-7e5b76f0-2776-4a63-9a27-1b1e980935dc" label="lyrics-like">super sénes intelléxi:*quia</l><l xml:id="m-65bca202-e919-4354-bda1-500e434e0512" facs="#m-7e281a55-dc1b-4f5b-bb2c-26c87d2367ce" label="lyrics-like">stimónia túa.</l><l xml:id="m-6bee2dfd-e0f3-43f6-b172-98e7161f9d8d" facs="#m-1a71f648-8615-44c9-b0e6-2be7d0044c4d" label="lyrics-like">Confige timóre túo cárnes</l><l xml:id="m-60df8d33-7828-41ee-8189-b04746bd8b93" facs="#m-a3cb5d77-4c1c-4df3-8689-46d232ead7e6" label="lyrics-like">mandáta túa quaesivi.</l><l xml:id="m-a6d41f0e-ecb8-4686-9d4c-1cc2b60a6735" facs="#m-ce1c37c1-666c-4de6-bed0-46ef8ba4e82f" label="lyrics-like">Ab ómni via mála prohibui</l><l xml:id="m-aca11649-9d52-4f37-8396-d5706e903291" facs="#m-1c49d7da-1367-4494-ad47-3281a2e75a66" label="lyrics-like">méas: Y a judiciis enim túis timui.</l><l xml:id="m-2f6a06b9-b5e4-49ee-b5ca-f2a4850eb358" facs="#m-a47fcffa-1fc3-4512-9d2b-f66e1ccdfeee" label="lyrics-like">pédes méos :* ut custódiam verba</l><l xml:id="m-856fc3de-f601-4b4e-bfb4-4d586ece3f3b" facs="#m-93598be1-31da-442f-93da-abebdbb8f36e" label="lyrics-like">Féci judícium et justitiam :* non</l><l xml:id="m-81ee2c64-afea-435b-b452-2405541619b8" facs="#m-f7c075ea-4657-4082-a433-9df492474cff" label="lyrics-like">túa.</l><l xml:id="m-221b2e73-fc0a-40ea-b569-a3b06789da61" facs="#m-de50db6d-08f7-4b85-99d3-1bb1680a5b7f" label="lyrics-like">trádas me calumniántibus me.</l><l xml:id="m-efccf748-c303-46af-a818-bad431fa13f9" facs="#m-93e5a03a-02e1-46d8-b242-4b9c685ba19d" label="lyrics-like">A judiciis túis non declinávi:"</l><l xml:id="m-7e692010-66d8-4c46-9aed-e752facf22b2" facs="#m-9a0fb125-40e8-48d1-933b-abd8318b488d" label="lyrics-like">Súscipesérvum túum in bónum:</l><l xml:id="m-db9c519e-1583-4502-8f0e-9a8e9392f44f" facs="#m-f56d3b13-52c7-4497-9127-91cc3f6150c4" label="lyrics-like">quia tu légem posuisti mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-224adc4d-fdbf-487b-a5e3-634007a251aa" facs="#m-44f8af3b-013e-480a-956d-f9b95e50b8f9" label="lyrics-like">non calumniéntur mé supérbi.</l><l xml:id="m-326f2d15-e883-439d-8129-1a796738d866" facs="#m-f5a2ce00-2313-41ad-948d-5f5909b532e5" label="lyrics-like">Quam dúlcia fáucibus méis eló¬</l><l xml:id="m-b52038f7-8dd8-4d2c-9b9f-444cddb08518" facs="#m-88ad614f-2dc4-4f5e-b7db-9f66520e998a" label="lyrics-like">Oculi méi defecérunt in salutáre</l><l xml:id="m-d5da5c5e-e77a-48e9-a763-65fcd7ff9747" facs="#m-08bbd488-43f1-4df7-b3fa-198ec2cfdb1a" label="lyrics-like">tuum:*et in elóquium justitiae</l><l xml:id="m-539d1f93-bf03-40fc-a00c-1477f2bf3aa2" facs="#m-8f078824-b2b1-463b-91bc-d92cef390c9a" label="lyrics-like">quia túa!* super mel óri méo.</l><l xml:id="m-c174f3b3-b437-4995-be76-cdcbebaa460f" facs="#m-622a7a05-01c2-4cee-9e66-096ec3694131" label="lyrics-like">A mandátis túis intelléxi :* pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f28a6ff-fa6e-4639-9bb2-75c5ccb805fc" facs="#m-71e56e4f-25c9-44ac-aebd-aa8ce797e5cc" label="lyrics-like">túae.</l><l xml:id="m-5d03c374-76e9-4325-8ec4-9fe0633d095b" facs="#m-8741ce50-7924-4aaf-924d-e4e6b3707a5c" label="lyrics-like">Fac cum sérvo túo secúndum mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-aadd0db3-e1ce-495f-b5cb-51fdd0016522" facs="#m-6f7c2291-b28d-4daa-8cdc-6825c76b4709" label="lyrics-like">ptérea odivi ómnem viam iniqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7f15523-14b0-4110-b422-b8787a2270f9" facs="#m-4b72b48a-5cf6-47d9-80fb-a19fd31b2ec5" label="lyrics-like">tátis.</l><l xml:id="m-8cc0cd65-fa9c-4170-a829-691ed7d73285" facs="#m-56670847-585f-44b4-a805-a8443c5eb42d" label="lyrics-like">sericórdiam túam: *et justifica¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce7d922a-e42f-46a9-94d9-291a870b5fe6" facs="#m-0631699b-503d-44b9-879d-a0c86edfc762" label="lyrics-like">Lucérna pédibus méis vérbum</l><l xml:id="m-19b28d8f-2e2a-4814-967e-f70a3679fe3f" facs="#m-1ea30d35-8deb-470f-ab8a-e895043cadbe" label="lyrics-like">tiónes túas dóce me.</l><l xml:id="m-0544bfcc-65bf-41c7-8408-fb4bed8bbc25" facs="#m-89ba60de-8b71-4a01-88fb-611da371b098" label="lyrics-like">túum, * et lúmen sémitis méis.</l><l xml:id="m-e74badee-ee43-470d-b059-99b2c0c3bada" facs="#m-90744259-7779-4725-a594-148ae584c009" label="lyrics-like">Sérvus túus sum égo :* da míhi</l><l xml:id="m-bf681e0c-f86d-47bd-b81d-ec5046bfa058" facs="#m-ef628fda-b38a-4304-9ed6-ff1645165cf6" label="lyrics-like">Jurávi, et státui * custodire ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-051aadce-03f5-45a2-86d0-3bfdf9d2ac13" facs="#m-46d888b6-bd8e-4090-824a-b77d87bd2221" label="lyrics-like">intelléctum, utsciam testimónia túa.</l><l xml:id="m-5bd9c312-0cb7-4d9a-99e8-f709c2f17472" facs="#m-87ef289c-bb6d-4b05-9cb9-d60e6fa079fe" label="lyrics-like">dic̃ia justitiae tuae.</l><l xml:id="m-0b9a1356-e380-4668-bd8c-aa4e4db1e5c8" facs="#m-ac518cf1-bb7a-4532-9d58-38ea0d16e2eb" label="lyrics-like">Témpus faciéndi, Dómine :* dis¬</l><l xml:id="m-2fbeb28e-5953-43f0-b51d-99d704cb4f2a" facs="#m-17658421-9960-4832-9564-9259f16a2d77" label="lyrics-like">Humiliátus sum usquequáque</l><l xml:id="m-ff9dbe98-9e32-4c38-89de-bbe1e4634778" facs="#m-a439c875-3234-4e22-9215-dd2d2c42bdf2" label="lyrics-like">sipavérunt légem tüam.</l><l xml:id="m-e37fabfc-9991-4175-ba91-173251ade544" facs="#m-2aade4ac-7b4d-4c2a-83e2-bd30bc721302" label="lyrics-like">Dómine:"*vivífica me secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-a1389dca-44a5-4aae-862a-c9e667569f50" facs="#m-ccb173ab-15cf-4415-8a64-0c67a9adf856" label="lyrics-like">Ideo diléxi mandáta túa, * super</l><l xml:id="m-34d9f059-0dbf-41ce-b308-c2e09824d6d5" facs="#m-f1255f87-0e6b-4104-8809-2fe0e6171a5f" label="lyrics-like">vérbum túum.</l><l xml:id="m-52bbfe5b-abb7-4231-82fa-ab79e7dfd533" facs="#m-e824c656-52a4-4536-b2a0-0ba24b03cf65" label="lyrics-like">áurum et topázion.</l><l xml:id="m-838e0e00-4f9e-41c4-9411-3bc838e6f66e" facs="#m-f625f076-dfaf-4ec6-9d30-11681f1f466b" label="lyrics-like">Voluntária óris méi beneplácita</l><l xml:id="m-7cdeab82-fae1-4d7c-aee2-b9201c3915be" facs="#m-ce20f9d8-0a14-4360-aac7-cc3ba6377079" label="lyrics-like">Proptérea ad ómnia mandáta túa</l><l xml:id="m-431d3443-19ad-44b4-8c68-3855b0eaa49f" facs="#m-10602ae1-5dbc-4c52-9e98-a55b29cb6f19" label="lyrics-like">fac Dómine:* et judicia túa dóce</l><l xml:id="m-8bb908f7-7a9b-432b-8724-87fe8fa5bbc5" facs="#m-7d50d8f3-5192-4914-a643-a3411385de95" label="lyrics-like">dirigébar : * ómnem víam iniquam</l><l xml:id="m-2ac6ae31-30ad-4f4c-b34c-dc11f443a4a7" facs="#m-d85b9455-b521-4c5d-bb54-435525e4cb40" label="lyrics-like">ódio hábui.</l><l xml:id="m-d1dc48db-49ce-425f-9a02-e19497c0726d" facs="#m-8a8a659e-1da7-4023-b832-68588f73d0c1" label="ambiguous">me.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
